Title: F1-M04 — Hold the Switchyard (briefing)
Credit: Staalfront
Author: Staalfront narrative team
Draft date: 2026-10-17

FADE IN:

INT. FORWARD COMMAND POST - DAWN

[[AMBIENCE: radio hiss, distant engines, wind against canvas]]
[[MUSIC: restrained military tension]]

A map of the operational area is spread across a table. CAPTAIN ELIAN and MIRA stand over it.

CAPTAIN ELIAN
(serious)
The switchyard feeds every forward position on this front. If it falls, reinforcements will arrive one at a time.

[[SHOT: map]]
[[MAP: operational area, player start, objective route, enemy approach]]

MIRA
(measured)
The enemy has enough armour to test every approach. Engineers need eighteen minutes to disable the rail spur.

CAPTAIN ELIAN
(firm)
Build layered defences and hold the yard until the rail line is cut. Do not let the engineers be overrun.

[[SFX: radio click]]
[[MUSIC: stop]]

FADE OUT.
